    "key": "skill.1931.description",
    "text": "Consumes <style=\"accent-gn\">40</style> points of <style=\"accent-gn\">Rage</style>, violently slams down the weapon, dealing <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> to surrounding enemies, and enters the <style=\"accent-gn\">Countercrush</style> state. During this time, Block Chance +<style=\"accent-gn\">100%</style>, <style=\"physical\">Attack DMG</style> taken from blocks -<style=\"accent-gn\">30%</style>. <br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">Tips: Very effective in environments with mostly Attack DMG. After casting, the block chance increases, reliably reducing Attack DMG taken.</style></size>",
